        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche iltung'ana le Israel anaa enaikenaki too nkajijik oo loo menye; ore lelo pooki apa ootii ilng'oborri ooikenaki too lturrurri lenye naa nkalifuni iip ile o okuni o iip imiet o onom. ",
